@startuml F5.8-D02-criar-disciplina
title F5.8-D02 — Criar disciplina
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "SubjectController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar disciplina
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /academico/disciplinas
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT disciplina\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Sec: badge Ativa

@enduml
